      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 26.0,
      "text": "All the rooms are breathing now, seat and root and rain together"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 46.0,
      "text": "Every chamber in the ring keeps its own interior climate"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.0,
      "end": 52.0,
      "text": "The first cost still lives in soil, faint beneath the new worries"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.0,
      "end": 59.0,
      "text": "Barrowed sun still warm, the trellis transparent veins still teach belief"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.0,
      "end": 66.0,
      "text": "I'm just remember sleepless hands, my string members open rules"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.0,
      "end": 72.0,
